      "is": "IS 1365:1978",
      "clause": "3",
      "title": "Designation",
      "text": "3. Designation — Shall be designated by name, nominal size, length, the number of this standard and the property class. For example, a slotted countersunk head screw of size M4, length 10 mm and of property class 4.8 shall be designated as : Countersunk Screw M4 × 10 —IS  1365—4.8 For  detailed information, refer to IS 1365 : 1978 Specification for slotted countersunk head screws (third revision).",
